LISTEN TO THIS.

00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:10.051
&gt;&gt; BY THE TIME WE IMMUNIZE 50

00:02:10.052 --> 00:02:11.676
OR 60 MILLION PEOPLE WE CAN

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:13.365
HAVE ALL THE LONG-TERM CARE

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:13.770
FACILITY.

00:02:13.771 --> 00:02:15.971
A LOT OF THE AT-RISK PEOPLE AND

00:02:15.972 --> 00:02:18.833
WE’LL GET A LOT OF THE BENEFIT.

00:02:18.867 --> 00:02:20.464
WE WILL NOT END THE PANDEMIC,

00:02:20.499 --> 00:02:22.249
REALLY END THE DISEASE

00:02:22.251 --> 00:02:24.267
TRANSMISSION UNTIL WE HAVE AT

00:02:24.269 --> 00:02:27.143
LEAST ABOUT 70 TO 80% OF THE

00:02:27.178 --> 00:02:28.993
AMERICAN PEOPLE WHO HAVE EITHER

00:02:29.027 --> 00:02:31.409
