00:02:47.293 --> 00:02:48.606
&gt;&gt; YES, THAT’S ABSOLUTELY

00:02:48.607 --> 00:02:48.930
POSSIBLE.

00:02:48.965 --> 00:02:51.181
THAT’S OUR PLAN AND WE FEEL

00:02:51.182 --> 00:02:53.176
VERY CONFIDENT THAT WE WILL BE

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:54.715
