I THINK AT THIS MOMENT THE

00:03:02.799 --> 00:03:05.332
HIGHEST CONCERN I HAVE IS THE

00:03:05.333 --> 00:03:07.030
LEVEL OF HESITANCY WITHIN THE

00:03:07.064 --> 00:03:08.462
POPULATION AS TO ACCEPTING

00:03:08.496 --> 00:03:09.658
WHETHER THEY WILL BE IMMUNIZEED

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:10.312
