00:03:29.632 --> 00:03:31.120
ADVISING THE FDA AND MORE

00:03:31.121 --> 00:03:33.929
EXPERTS HAVE ACCESS TO THE DATA

00:03:33.963 --> 00:03:35.867
AND HOPE TO RELAY TO THE

00:03:35.868 --> 00:03:36.818
POPULATION INDEPENDENTLY HOW

00:03:36.819 --> 00:03:38.277
EFFECTIVE THESE VACCINES ARE.

00:03:38.278 --> 00:03:40.783
I WOULD LIKE TO ALSO SAY THAT

00:03:40.784 --> 00:03:44.591
WE HAVE THESE TWO VACCINES, THE

00:03:44.625 --> 00:03:46.687
PFIZER AND  MODERNA WILL BE

00:03:46.721 --> 00:03:47.465
REVIEWED.

