00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:57.966
WE HOPE, IN FEBRUARY TO FURTHER

00:03:57.967 --> 00:03:59.173
INCREASE THE NUMBER OF DOSES WE

00:03:59.175 --> 00:03:59.591
HAVE.

00:03:59.592 --> 00:04:01.649
THAT’S WHY WE FEEL CONFIDENT WE

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:04.613
WILL BE ABLE TO IMMUNIZE THE

00:04:04.614 --> 00:04:06.519
U.S. POPULATION AS A WHOLE.

00:04:06.554 --> 00:04:08.495
&gt;&gt; Sandra: DR. SLAOUI, HOW DO

00:04:08.529 --> 00:04:10.064
YOU ADDRESS THAT PUBLIC FEAR?

00:04:10.065 --> 00:04:12.693
AS THE DOCTOR HEADING UP WARP

00:04:12.695 --> 00:04:14.947
SPEED AND MAKING SURE THIS

00:04:14.982 --> 00:04:16.265
VACCINE IS AVAILABLE, THAT’S AN

00:04:16.266 --> 00:04:17.089
ENORMOUS TASK YOU HAVE

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:17.607
UNDERTAKEN.

00:04:17.641 --> 00:04:19.773
DID YOU THINK ABOUT THE PUBLIC

00:04:19.808 --> 00:04:21.063
