YOU WALK DOWN THE STREET AND

00:04:23.015 --> 00:04:25.010
ASK PEOPLE WILL YOU GET IT IF

00:04:25.044 --> 00:04:26.064
IT’S AVAILABLE AT YOUR LOCAL

00:04:26.065 --> 00:04:26.720
