00:04:40.027 --> 00:04:42.358
FIRST EXPLAIN WHY WE WENT FAST.

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:43.971
WE WENT FAST NOT BY CUTTING ANY

00:04:44.005 --> 00:04:44.557
CORNERS.

00:04:44.591 --> 00:04:46.351
WE TOOK ADVANTAGE OF THE

00:04:46.385 --> 00:04:47.687
TECHNOLOGICAL ADVANCES THAT

00:04:47.689 --> 00:04:50.256
HAPPENED OVER THE LAST 10 YEARS

00:04:50.258 --> 00:04:51.565
AND TOOK FINANCIAL RISK AND

00:04:51.567 --> 00:04:52.297
OPERATIONAL RISKS.

00:04:52.299 --> 00:04:54.206
WE DID LARGER TRIALS THAN WHAT

00:04:54.241 --> 00:04:55.163
IS NEEDED.

00:04:55.198 --> 00:04:57.544
THOSE ARE THE THINGS THAT HAVE

00:04:57.578 --> 00:04:58.965
ALLOWED US TO GO VERY FAST,

00:04:58.999 --> 00:04:59.713
NUMBER ONE.

00:04:59.748 --> 00:05:01.990
NUMBER TWO, WE WILL MAKE ALL

00:05:01.991 --> 00:05:03.335
