00:05:03.369 --> 00:05:05.099
AND HAVE INDEPENDENT EXPERTS

00:05:05.133 --> 00:05:07.267
LOOK INTO IT AND EXPLAIN IT TO

00:05:07.301 --> 00:05:08.757
THE POPULATION.

00:05:08.791 --> 00:05:10.679
HOPEFULLY PEOPLE HAVE DIFFERENT

00:05:10.714 --> 00:05:12.898
EXPERTS THAT THEY MAY TRUST.

00:05:12.932 --> 00:05:15.110
I ASK PEOPLE TO JUST KEEP YOUR

00:05:15.145 --> 00:05:16.497
MIND OPEN, PLEASE.

00:05:16.532 --> 00:05:18.242
DON’T COME TO A CONCLUSION

00:05:18.276 --> 00:05:19.539
BEFORE YOU HAVE BEEN EXPOSED TO

00:05:19.573 --> 00:05:20.734
THE DATA.

00:05:20.768 --> 00:05:23.994
THEN THE THIRD THING I SAY IS

00:05:24.029 --> 00:05:25.008
PERSONAL EXAMPLE.

00:05:25.042 --> 00:05:26.939
I HAVE AN 8-YEAR-OLD KID, AS

00:05:26.941 --> 00:05:28.241
SOON AS THIS VACCINE BECOMES

00:05:28.242 --> 00:05:29.051
AVAILABLE FOR CHILDREN.

00:05:29.053 --> 00:05:31.138
IT IS NOT YET NOW, I WILL MAKE

00:05:31.172 --> 00:05:32.079
SURE HE HAS IT.

00:05:32.113 --> 00:05:33.809
I WILL TAKE THE VACCINE AS SOON

00:05:33.811 --> 00:05:35.431
AS IT IS APPROVED IF I’M

00:05:35.432 --> 00:05:37.151
AUTHORIZED TO DO SO.

00:05:37.152 --> 00:05:38.721
AND THOSE ARE THE LEVEL OF

00:05:38.722 --> 00:05:40.034
CONFIDENCE I HAVE FOR THE

00:05:40.069 --> 00:05:41.675
PEOPLE I LOVE MOST ON THE EARTH

00:05:41.676 --> 00:05:43.078
TO MAKE SURE THEY GET THE

00:05:43.079 --> 00:05:44.458
VACCINE BECAUSE I KNOW THE DATA

00:05:44.492 --> 00:05:47.284
AND I KNOW IT’S SAFE AND

00:05:47.285 --> 00:05:49.060
